From 733997f252cd06d20287bc01ca0c9029ced71df3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zeyad Nasef <zeyad.nasef.fci@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:59:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(spotify): open Spotify links in Meld

open.spotify.com wasn't declared in the manifest, so Android never offered
it under "Open by default", and handleDeepLinkIntent only knew YouTube URLs
so a Spotify link opened the app and did nothing.

Playlists and albums now go to the existing Spotify screens, tracks play
through SpotifyQueue like they do from home, and artists open the matching
YT Music artist. Works for shared links too. Episodes and shows just show a
toast since we can't play podcasts from Spotify.

The filter isn't autoVerify (we can't verify spotify.com), so users have to
add the link manually in the app's "Open by default" settings.
